@startuml Upload new file flow
title Upload new file flow

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Storage Service" as Storage
participant "Billing Service" as Billing
database "Object Storage" as ObjectStorage
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Metadata Service" as Metadata
participant "Sync Service" as Sync
participant "Thumbnail Service" as Thumbnail
participant "Search Service" as Search
participant "Permission Service" as Permission

User -> App : Select file

App -> Gateway : POST /files/upload\nfile_name, size, type, folder_id
Gateway -> Auth : Validate token
Auth --> Gateway : user_id

Gateway -> Storage : Init upload request\nuser_id, file metadata
Storage -> Billing : Check quota and paid plan\nuser_id, file_size
Billing --> Storage : OK

Storage -> Storage : Generate signed URL
Storage --> Gateway : upload_id, signed_url
Gateway --> App : upload_id, signed_url

App -> ObjectStorage : Upload file using signed URL
ObjectStorage --> App : Upload completed

App --> User : File uploaded.\nIt will appear on other devices after processing.

ObjectStorage -> Storage : ObjectCreated event\nobject_id

Storage -> Kafka : Publish FileUploaded event\nfile_id, user_id, object_id,\nfile_name, size, folder_id
'using par because actions can be done in parallel
par Metadata creation
    Kafka ->> Metadata : FileUploaded event
    Metadata -> Metadata : Create file metadata record

    else Sync update
    Kafka ->> Sync : FileUploaded event
    Sync --> App : Notify other devices\n

    else Thumbnail generation
    Kafka ->>Thumbnail : FileUploaded event
    Thumbnail -> ObjectStorage : Read original file
    ObjectStorage --> Thumbnail : File content
    Thumbnail -> Thumbnail : Generate thumbnail
    Thumbnail -> ObjectStorage : Save thumbnail
    ObjectStorage --> Thumbnail : thumbnail_object_key
    Thumbnail -> Metadata : Update thumbnail path\nfile_id, thumbnail_object_key
    Metadata -> Metadata : Save thumbnail_key in Metadata DB
    Metadata -> Thumbnail : ok

    else Search indexing
    Kafka ->> Search : FileUploaded event
    Search -> Search : Update Search Index

    else Permission initialization
    Kafka ->> Permission : FileUploaded event
    Permission -> Permission : Add permissions for user_id\nread/edit/delete

    else Billing update
    Kafka ->> Billing : FileUploaded event
    Billing -> Billing : Update used storage
end

@enduml